  "draft_py": "# Inspiring Call: \"Draw a card for each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it. Those\n# creatures gain indestructible until end of turn.\"\n# Sentence 1: DRAW of \"N for each X\" = QBin(MUL, QConst(N), QCount(...)) (MAPPER_GUIDE; M21 Canopy\n# Stalker's \"1 life for each\"), \"a card\" N = 1, over M21 Pridemalkin's selector \"each creature you\n# control with a +1/+1 counter on it\" (HAS_COUNTER +1/+1). Sentence 2: GRANT_ABILITY\n# (INDESTRUCTIBLE) until end of turn over the same creatures (the same ALL selector, read as the\n# spell resolves; the draw changes no counters), as Overcome repeats its selector.\nwith_counter = Selector(\n    count=QUnbounded(),\n    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n    filter=FAnd(children=(\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.HAS_COUNTER, count=QConst(value=1), counter_kind=CounterKind.PLUS_1_PLUS_1),\n    )),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nabilities = [\n    SpellAbility(\n        kind=SpellKind.INSTANT,\n        effect=Seq(steps=(\n            A(Verb.DRAW, {\n                'amount': QBin(op=QBinOp.MUL, left=QConst(value=1), right=QCount(selector=with_counter)),\n                'controller': ControllerRef.YOU,\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.INDESTRUCTIBLE),\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'target': with_counter,\n            }),\n        )),\n    ),\n]\n",
